# name: test/sql/rusty_tpch.test
# description: test rusty_quack extension
# group: [quack]

# Before we load the extension, this will fail
statement error
CALL tpch_gen(0.1, 'tmp/dir');
----
Catalog Error: Table Function with name tpch_gen does not exist!

# Require statement will ensure the extension is loaded from now on
require rusty_tpch

require icu

# Confirm the extension works
query I
CALL tpch_gen(0.1, 'tmp/dir');
----
Successfully generated TPC-H data